OL,3,GNEWSAOlympics chief joins Marlow
OL,4,AStudios leadership team
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo executives who helped deliver the
OL,7,F2012 Olympics and create Wembley Park
OL,8,Fhave been appointed to lead Marlow
OL,9,FStudios.
OL,11,FThe Buckinghamshire film studio is
OL,12,Fexpected to support more than 2,000
OL,13,Fjobs during its 44-month construction,
OL,14,Fwith preliminary work having begun
OL,15,Fearlier this year.
OL,17,FSir John Armitt, who chaired the
OL,18,FOlympic Delivery Authority, has been
OL,19,Fappointed chairman, while Max James has
OL,20,Fbecome chief executive.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
